design/mfg/assembly/assembly.md:201: - **Join:** the foot of FLEX1 to J_BAND_A (8 lands) and the foot of FLEX2 to J_BAND_B (7 lands), on the board's parts face, by hot bar, on the solder layer that step 2 put on the 15 lands (`design/ecad/band/band-interface.md:137`, `design/mfg/assembly/hotbar-joint.md:23`). The joint is made on the bench BEFORE the ribbons go into the body: board parts face up on the fixture, foot on top, lands down, hot bar from above (the owner's decision, `design/wiring/lead-decisions.md:81`). FLEX1 first, then FLEX2. Flux: Kester 959T, a no-clean liquid flux (`design/mfg/assembly/process.md:67`; confirmed, 
