design/wiring/lead-decisions.md:71: | case thermistor TH1 leads (joint C3) and bead size | Maker's sheet (Semitec AT series, 103AT-2, shape 2): two bare leads of 0.5 mm tin plated 42 alloy at 2.54 mm pitch; no insulation, no colour, no polarity (a thermistor has none). Bead at most 2.4 mm high and 4.0 mm long: the parts list's "1.6 dia start value" is replaced by these. Soldering, from the maker: at least 5 mm from the bead, at most 7 seconds at 340 degrees C with a 50 W iron. Fixed for the builder: leads cut to 10 mm from the bead, soldered into the two plated holes TH1.1 and TH1.2 (either way round), the joint 5 mm or more fro
